node_modules/
dist/
.env

# SQLite files are regenerated on first run and are binary — never committed.
db/
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# Evidence IS a deliverable: a saved artifact plus the discovery and replay run
# logs that produced and consumed it. Committed deliberately, and kept small —
# it is a demonstration, not an archive. Screenshots are kept only for runs that
# escalated, since those are what show a handoff actually happening.
#
# The test suite writes fixture artifacts here as a side effect — "Test goal"
# against tenant-001 and friends. The named ones are excluded below, but the
# suite also emits UUID-named fixtures indistinguishable from a real capture, so
# stage evidence files individually rather than adding the directory wholesale.
evidence/artifacts/artifact-*.json

# Local planning notes, by name — a blanket *.md rule would also swallow
# REPORT.md and KNOWN_LIMITATIONS.md, which belong in the repo.
CHANGES.md
pending_codereview.md
phase1.md
*.docx

